rds. These statements include but are not limited to statements regarding the Company's anticipated financial performance and outlook for 2026, including expected revenue growth, gross margin and adjusted EBITDA; anticipated customer orders and the timing and likelihood of converting sales opportunities into bookings and revenue; expected demand for the Company's products across defense and commercial markets; anticipated customer-funded development activity; the Company's ability to expand its customer base and market opportunities; and its ability to execute</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></div>
